WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.296 --> 00:00:15.539
The platform owner signs in on the same page as everyone else, with the admin email and password.

2
00:00:15.639 --> 00:00:20.674
You land in the Super Admin panel. Its menu is short: one entry for each job.

3
00:00:20.774 --> 00:00:26.800
The dashboard covers every business at once. Pick the period with the buttons at the top right.

4
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:32.322
The numbers below are compared with the period before, so you see growth or decline.

5
00:00:32.422 --> 00:00:38.778
The top cards count new and active businesses, plus the sales and sales value rung up by all of them.

6
00:00:38.878 --> 00:00:45.344
Needs attention lists businesses close to a plan limit or with a billing problem, so you can act early.

7
00:00:45.444 --> 00:00:52.075
Health scores each business from recent sales, subscription state and setup: healthy, at risk or critical.

8
00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:58.942
Businesses and Subscriptions show how many are trialling, active, past due or expired.

9
00:00:59.042 --> 00:01:04.904
Monthly recurring revenue adds up active paid plans, with yearly plans counted as a twelfth.

10
00:01:05.005 --> 00:01:09.877
Scroll down for the sales trend, plan mix and the top businesses by sales.

11
00:01:09.977 --> 00:01:15.731
Recent sign-ups, quiet businesses, failed payments and trials ending soon each get a card.

12
00:01:15.831 --> 00:01:23.186
Recent activity shows what admins did lately. The Audit log link opens the full history.

13
00:01:25.079 --> 00:01:28.575
That is the dashboard. Next, the Businesses list.
